		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>1 Action, Shepherd Only</strong></p><p>Summon a spirit companion (max 1) that follows you and is immune to harm. It can travel up to 4 spaces away from you in order to:</p><p><strong>Harm.</strong> 1 Action: (Reach 4) It attacks for 1d8+STR (ignoring Armor).</p><p><strong>Mend.</strong> 1 Action: (WIL/Safe Rest, Reach 4) It restores WIL d20 HP to a Dying creature.</p><p>[A] Casting this rolls Harm. Mend is the <em>My Buddy!</em> feature, which spends a Mend charge.</p><p><em>Rushed Attacks and My Companion?</em> You and your companion use the same action pool, but count as different creatures. So you can each attack once without the Rushed Attack penalty every round.</p>",
			"higherLevelEffect": "<p>+STR damage every 5 levels.</p>",
